    "title": "Biography",
    "subtitle": "About the artist",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Victoria Chikalkina is a concert pianist whose performances combine refined lyricism with a deeply considered interpretive voice. Her recitals and orchestral appearances span Europe and Asia, with a particular focus on the Romantic and late Classical repertoire.",
      "A graduate of leading conservatories, she has worked with distinguished mentors and continues to develop projects that connect the concert stage with educational outreach and contemporary programming."
